gle fill. It is the cropped transform-only residue: a diagonal band plus two edge\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3093:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/23/code.py:17:#      while color B mirrors the diagonal sense.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3094:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/23/code.py:407:    - Rebuild the segment as three monotone phases in the bar's forward frame: diagonal approach, straight\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3095:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/23/code.py:408:      alongside run, and opposite diagonal exit.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3096:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/23/code.py:411:    - The obstacle color decides whether the diagonal phases bend clockwise or counterclockwise.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3097:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/code.py:163:def _infer_fill_diagonal(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3098:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/code.py:167:    Infer the hidden bbox and the opposite fill diagonal from two partial boundary segments.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3099:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/code.py:173:    determine which diagonal was marked.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3100:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/code.py:211:    assert score_tlbr != score_trbl, \"marker diagonal must be uniquely determined\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3101:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/code.py:255:    rmin, rmax, cmin, cmax, a, b = _infer_fill_diagonal(marker_pts)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3102:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/8/co