   toward the legend direction. For diagonal steps it allows moving straight into the diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3227:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:47:    - Generated legends are diagonal-only. This is deliberate: the fused behavior depends on a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3228:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:48:      diagonal slip through obstacle corners, so cardinal cases would hide the D16 contribution.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3229:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:50:      That keeps the scene readable while still giving repeated evidence that the diagonal pinch is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3230:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:60:      obstacle layouts require routing, and the diagonal gate is legal only if corner cutting is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3231:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:64:    - The original diagonal check assumed both orthogonal intermediates must be inside the room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3232:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:70:    - Each obstacle barrier spans the room interior top-to-bottom and leaves exactly one diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3233:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:77:      begins on the wrong side of that barrier yet the output yellow appears on the far diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3234:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:78:      side. The diagonal pinch is visible in the input itself.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3235:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:80:      diagonal step and the no-corner-cut solver would stop closer to the start side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3236:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:86:    - At most two rooms are generated, which avoids overcrowding around the 6x7 diagonal legends.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3237:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:97:    - The solver assumes legends exist and point diagonally; generator always places 1-2 diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3238:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:325:    - Border legends are diagonal 6x7 rectangles whose fill color matches the wall color of the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3239:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:331:    - Use the legend matching that room's wall color to get a diagonal direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3240:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:337:    - The obstacle barrier can separate the room into chambers that touch only at a diagonal pinch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3241:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:338:      Matching wall color to legend gives the intended diagonal, and allowing diagonal corner cuts\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3242:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/42/code.py:346:    assert dirs, \"legend_directions must find at least one diagonal border legend\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3243:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9385bd28/23/code.py:29:#    infer which bbox diagonal contains the two L-corners, then fill the opposite-diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3244:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ces